# Estimate whether a door is open or closed from the robot's sensors (laser scan).
# The door pivot/extent points are given in the map frame (from the semantic map).
# Only the two states "closed" and "fully open" are distinguished.
arips_semantic_map_msgs/Door door
---
bool success          # false if the door could not be observed well enough
string error_message
bool is_open
float64 angle_deg     # estimated leaf angle, ccw around the pivot from the closed position
float64 closed_ratio  # fraction of laser beams crossing the closed door line that hit the leaf
int32 num_beams       # number of laser beams crossing the closed door line
